Package: quotaassignment
Type: Project
Title: Geographic Variation in Reservation Allocation
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Gaurav", "Sood", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "contact@gsood.com")
Description: Reproducible analyses of reservation allocation among gram
    panchayat heads in Rajasthan and Uttar Pradesh. Describes district and
    block variation in women's reservation and audits population linkage
    for Scheduled Caste and Scheduled Tribe assignment diagnostics.
